{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/","title":"팔맥교회혈(八脈交會穴) 임상 지식망","language":"ko-KR","description":"기경팔맥과 연결되는 8개 교회혈과 4개 대표 배혈쌍을 임상 영역과 함께 정리합니다.","text":"팔맥교회혈(八脈交會穴) 임상 지식망\n팔맥교회혈은 십이경맥의 혈이 기경팔맥과 연결되는 지점을 보여주는 중요한 배혈 체계입니다.\n여덟 교회혈\n경혈\n연결 기경\n대표 짝\nSP4 공손\n충맥\nPC6 내관\nPC6 내관\n음유맥\nSP4 공손\nGB41 족임읍\n대맥\nTE5 외관\nTE5 외관\n양유맥\nGB41 족임읍\nSI3 후계\n독맥\nBL62 신맥\nBL62 신맥\n양교맥\nSI3 후계\nLU7 열결\n임맥\nKI6 조해\nKI6 조해\n음교맥\nLU7 열결\n네 가지 대표 조합\n공손 + 내관\n충맥·음유맥. 복부·흉부·소화·심계·여성 증상 연결에 자주 언급됩니다.\n족임읍 + 외관\n대맥·양유맥. 측면부·소양경·두면부·옆구리 영역과 연결해 봅니다.\n후계 + 신맥\n독맥·양교맥. 척주·경항·후두·수면/각성 축과 연결됩니다.\n열결 + 조해\n임맥·음교맥. 흉부·인후·호흡기·하복부와 음교맥의 수면 연결을 함께 봅니다.\n함께 보기\n기경팔맥\n원락배혈\n경맥→증상 지도","sections":[{"title":"여덟 교회혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_2","text":"경혈\n연결 기경\n대표 짝\nSP4 공손\n충맥\nPC6 내관\nPC6 내관\n음유맥\nSP4 공손\nGB41 족임읍\n대맥\nTE5 외관\nTE5 외관\n양유맥\nGB41 족임읍\nSI3 후계\n독맥\nBL62 신맥\nBL62 신맥\n양교맥\nSI3 후계\nLU7 열결\n임맥\nKI6 조해\nKI6 조해\n음교맥\nLU7 열결","links":[]},{"title":"네 가지 대표 조합","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_3","text":"","links":[]},{"title":"공손 + 내관","level":3,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_4","text":"충맥·음유맥. 복부·흉부·소화·심계·여성 증상 연결에 자주 언급됩니다.","links":[]},{"title":"족임읍 + 외관","level":3,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_5","text":"대맥·양유맥. 측면부·소양경·두면부·옆구리 영역과 연결해 봅니다.","links":[]},{"title":"후계 + 신맥","level":3,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_6","text":"독맥·양교맥. 척주·경항·후두·수면/각성 축과 연결됩니다.","links":[]},{"title":"열결 + 조해","level":3,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_7","text":"임맥·음교맥. 흉부·인후·호흡기·하복부와 음교맥의 수면 연결을 함께 봅니다.","links":[]},{"title":"함께 보기","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_8","text":"기경팔맥\n원락배혈\n경맥→증상 지도","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/by-condition/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/extraordinary-vessels/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/yuan-luo-pairs/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"여덟 교회혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"네 가지 대표 조합","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_3"},{"level":3,"title":"공손 + 내관","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_4"},{"level":3,"title":"족임읍 + 외관","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_5"},{"level":3,"title":"후계 + 신맥","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_6"},{"level":3,"title":"열결 + 조해","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_7"},{"level":2,"title":"함께 보기","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/#_8"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/by-condition/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/extraordinary-vessels/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/yuan-luo-pairs/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-E5AA43C29F59851D","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/meridian-network/special-points/eight-confluent/","text_sha256":"3b58ec7f96071d95fcc868d5eecc1bc0e1c01407f8e195d8919e1e7da1749c8c","source_sha256":"e002edfa66c6499b37b5480ebf82aca3fed851e0b6c077b7aeb6395ed6294660","commit":"3c84c6ec199f87d89208c7e61c4a3ea77e6b1f44"}}
